   1: # Transfer and combination tests: complete protocol (2026-11-03)
   2: 
   3: **Status: researcher-directed protocol, 2026-11-03.** It completes Phase B and Phase C of the [restart plan](restart-plan-2026-10-30.md) section 8, as the [peer review of 2026-11-02](../../../research/reports/overnight-peer-review-2026-11-02/ranked-problems.md) required (problem 8). It replaces the outline in section 8 and the unapproved [combination draft](../../../research/reports/overnight-memory-plasticity-2026-10-31/combination-test-spec.md); both stay preserved. Nothing here may run before Phase A passes. No puzzles are generated and no sealed data is opened by this document.
