  51: **Arms (all with the same Phase B practice):**
  52: 
  53: | Arm | What it is |
  54: |---|---|
  55: | Phase-A fly | Phase A memory snapshot, then Phase B training |
  56: | Fresh fly | Starting memory, then Phase B training |
  57: | Shuffled fly | Phase A exposure with matched shuffled feedback, then Phase B training |
  58: | Plasticity-off fly | Same exposure, memory updates switched off |
  59: | Simple learner | Learner on raw photoreceptors, same exposure and feedback |
  60: | Similar-board recall | Answers each test board with the answer of its most similar trained eye input |
  61: | Exact-recall store | The separate answer file; no answer for new boards |
